WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.641
Now create a Workshop Registration.

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:08.450
Give it a title, such as Spring workshop.

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:15.176
Use Add step to add one card for each step, here Visitor Details and Visit Preferences.

00:00:15.176 --> 00:00:20.371
Each card holds that step's boxes, which can start with default values.

00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:24.133
The order of the cards is the order of the steps, and you

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.973
can drag a card to change it.

00:00:25.973 --> 00:00:27.182
Publish the item.

